00:04:51.353 --> 00:04:53.815
So anyway, I know that's
not exactly the topic,

00:04:53.815 --> 00:04:56.020
but it is around mental health generally.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:56.920
- Yeah.
- So I just,

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:59.710
that's actually been
ironically heavy on my mind,

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:02.430
