everything's good and it's summer.

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:03.716
So yeah it's hot,

00:05:03.716 --> 00:05:05.580
but it's good.
- Yeah. Yeah.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:06.413
- Glad to hear that.

00:05:06.413 --> 00:05:07.350
And I appreciate the
way that you're honest

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:09.567
