00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:36.470
Even though this is the first tour,

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:38.110
maybe not the first time
that you're in your purpose,

00:07:38.110 --> 00:07:40.365
but it sounds like it's
a whole nother level

00:07:40.365 --> 00:07:43.390
that everything is kind
of just tying in together,

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:44.980
- Yes.
- which I think is great.

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:46.370
So I think-
- It's all good.

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:47.203
- Yeah.

00:07:47.203 --> 00:07:50.002
- It's so good.
- I'm sure it's fulfilling

00:07:50.002 --> 00:07:52.223
and gratifying a lot of ways.

00:07:52.223 --> 00:07:53.880
To follow up briefly though,
- Yes.

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:55.070
even with your answer, I'm curious,

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:57.550
